; ========================================
; ＞『娯楽室』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Angle01/Option_Arms-
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛来到二楼的娱乐室，<br>便发现安安在里面。|#0102Adv22_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她静静地凝视着没有画面的银幕。<br>那侧脸看上去无比孤单。|#0102Adv22_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚和安安经常在这里<br>观看老电影。|#0102Adv22_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我们再也见不到那温馨的场面了——）|#0102Adv22_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:安安……你有发现什么线索吗？|#0102Adv22_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安无力地摇了摇头，<br>举起素描本。|#0102Adv22_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_01,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-

[PrintTextModified Text:『还没有』|#0102Adv22_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:我再去调查一下。|#0102Adv22_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（米莉亚的放风时间<br>　大多是在这娱乐室度过的）|#0102Adv22_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（说不定这里还留有什么线索）|#0102Adv22_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和安安<br>分头在娱乐室搜查起来。|#0102Adv22_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:-2,0 Zoom:0.5 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:接着，艾玛发现收纳柜上了锁<br>打不开。|#0102Adv22_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（奇怪……这个柜子打不开啊）|#0102Adv22_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然她有点在意，<br>但打不开的话只能暂时放弃。|#0102Adv22_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛大致搜查了一番，<br>但除此以外没发现什么别的东西。|#0102Adv22_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯——，这里好像什么都没有呢。<br>那我去其他——|#0102Adv22_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛刚朝门口转身，<br>她的裙摆就被拉了一下。|#0102Adv22_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她回头一看，安安正一脸泫然欲泣的表情<br>抬头望着她。|#0102Adv22_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR1,ArmL1,ArmR1-Option-All

[PrintTextModified Text:安安……你怎么了……？|#0102Adv22_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0102Adv22_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:安安欲言又止，<br>只是痛苦地摇了摇头。<br>艾玛似乎察觉到了她的情绪，也跟着想哭起来。|#0102Adv22_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我会找到凶手的，一定会。|#0102Adv22_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:安安点了点头。|#0102Adv22_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

